The optional ContextForge compatibility image is built from IBM ContextForge
v1.1.0, Apache License 2.0, with maintained downstream compatibility patches.
Source: https://github.com/IBM/mcp-context-forge
Upstream commit: aee91ff6db63b6aafa77522684a9483c418bb2a3
The repository records source and patch integrity in
integrations/contextforge/manifest.json. Full upstream source is fetched and
verified by scripts/prepare-contextforge.py and is not vendored in Git.
Its original LICENSE and copyright headers are preserved in the prepared
source and resulting image. Changes are described in
docs/upstream-contextforge.md. These hooks are downstream additions, not
unmodified upstream APIs or a stock CPEX-only integration.

This product includes a modified copy of ContextForge Web UI v0.2.4,
Copyright contributors to the MCP-CONTEXT-FORGE project, Apache License 2.0.
Source: https://github.com/contextforge-org/contextforge-web-ui
Upstream commit: 3ab7b7253b379b2afa5ad65b4d4150aa84ab7559
The original LICENSE and THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES are retained in dashboard/.
Modifications are described in docs/reuse-and-compatibility.md.

dashboard/src/vendor/shadcn.css is copied from shadcn 4.23.0 (MIT).
Its complete license is retained at dashboard/src/vendor/shadcn.LICENSE.

Other dependencies retain their licenses and notices as included in their
distributions. The optional image example uses Pillow 13.0.0 (MIT-CMU);
its distribution includes its license and bundled-library notices.

External services retain their respective licenses. Komodo is connected
through its HTTP API; its GPL-3.0 source is not copied into this project.
No Windmill source code is incorporated. Windmill is a design reference,
not a required runtime or dependency.
